vel":"soft","note":"No treaty or survey line exists: the Duero and Mondego frontiers are zones of raiding and resettlement ('Desert of the Duero'); the 884 peace is not described as a line."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kingdom_of_Asturias","title":"Kingdom of Asturias"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonso_I_of_Asturias","title":"Alfonso I of Asturias"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonso_II_of_Asturias","title":"Alfonso II of Asturias"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ordo%C3%B1o_I_of_Asturias","title":"Ordoño I of Asturias"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/County_of_Castile","title":"County of Castile"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfonso_III_of_Asturias","title":"Alfonso III of Asturias"}]}